{"title": "Supreme Githyanki Parry", "pageid": 9085, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Supreme_Githyanki_Parry", "categories": ["Reactions", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Parry\" title=\"Parry\">Parry</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Parry\" title=\"Githyanki Parry\">Githyanki Parry</a>      </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Parry.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Parry.webp/300px-Parry.webp, /w/images/9/94/Parry.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Parry.webp/300px-Parry.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Parry.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Supreme Githyanki Parry</b> is an NPC-exclusive passive feature and reaction that allows <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">githyanki</a> warriors to parry attacks with their greatswords, reducing incoming damage by 20.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Parry unarmed and weapon attacks to reduce their damage by 20. \n</p><p>You must be wielding a <a href=\"/wiki/Greatswords\" title=\"Greatswords\">Greatsword</a> and you can't be <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Incapacitated\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Incapacitated\">Incapacitated</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Blinded\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Blinded\">Blinded</a><sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\"><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Notes\">See Notes</a>]</i></sup>, or <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Restrained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Restrained\">Restrained</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt><dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></span> </dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Ready_to_Parry_.28Supreme.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Ready_to_Parry_(Supreme)\"> Condition: Ready to Parry (Supreme) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ready_to_Parry_(Supreme)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ready to Parry (Supreme) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Parry_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Parry_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Parry_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Parry_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Parry_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Parry_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ready to Parry\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Parry_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Parry_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Parry_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ready_to_Parry_(Supreme)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ready to Parry (Supreme) (Condition)\">Ready to Parry</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">Githyanki</a> stands ready to parry the next weapon attack, reducing its incoming damage by 20.</li>\n<li>The Githyanki can parry an attack as long as they have a <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a>, they wield a <a href=\"/wiki/Greatswords\" title=\"Greatswords\">greatsword</a>, and they aren't <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blinded</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Incapacitated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\">Incapacitated</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Restrained\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\">Restrained</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bradi%27ith\" title=\"Bradi'ith\">Bradi'ith</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Har%27rak\" title=\"Har'rak\">Har'rak</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ma%27athal\" title=\"Ma'athal\">Ma'athal</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Voss\" title=\"Voss\">Voss</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This feature is only available to certain githyanki NPCs.</li>\n<li>The in-game description has the requirement that the NPC must \"see the attacker\" which actually means that it can't be <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Blinded\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Blinded\">blinded</a>. Supreme Githyanki Parry works against characters which are <a href=\"/wiki/Hide\" title=\"Hide\">hidden</a>.</li>\n<li>At lower difficulty levels, <a href=\"/wiki/Veteran_Warrior\" title=\"Veteran Warrior\">Veteran Warriors</a> will instead have the basic <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Parry\" title=\"Githyanki Parry\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Parry_Icon.webp/25px-Parry_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Parry_Icon.webp/38px-Parry_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Parry_Icon.webp/50px-Parry_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Githyanki Parry\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Parry_Icon.webp/25px-Parry_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Parry_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Parry\" title=\"Githyanki Parry\">Githyanki Parry</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202652\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1281/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16870/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5891/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 322/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1026102/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.464      1 -total\n 98.21%   43.666      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 30.31%   13.475      1 Template:Condition\n 22.50%   10.006      1 Template:InfoBlob\n 21.48%    9.551      1 Template:ResourceList\n 12.73%    5.660      1 Template:Condition_full/format\n 10.92%    4.857      2 Template:Icon_link\n 10.06%    4.471      2 Template:Icon_text\n  9.76%    4.338      1 Template:PageSeo\n  9.06%    4.027      1 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache